WEBVTT

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.784
Baby, carry on

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:13.789
When the winds of tomorrow howl

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:19.795
Keep on laughing, be the cocky
person that you are

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.982
No matter what happens

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:34.366
Storming through life, during
the day you feel invincible

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:42.005
Of course, there are those nights
when everything falls apart

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:48.904
You find yourself humming
an old melody

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:56.098
Through the pain you feel as sweat
stings your wounded knee

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.134
Baby, carry on

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:02.561
Even on those mornings when
the wind blows in your face

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:09.245
Keep on laughing, and even the moon
shall one day look upon you

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:11.247
Someday your journey will come

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:16.485
| can at least make one
miracle happen

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.221
Until that day

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:25.184
Don't you surrender! Angel Blue!

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.486
Mistress Celcial

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:14.592
The restoration spell has broken apart?

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.395
What's the matter?

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.631
Come on, stand up, weenie!

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.589
Here, eat this.

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:44.097
Take this.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:52.114
That was your village guard?

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.902
What a joke.

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:58.042
| guess there was no reason for
Bonito to come out here.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.609
Enough screwing around!

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:07.963
Are you still going to play stupid,
Mr. Youth Leader?

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:11.150
Come on. Why don't we have the
elf come out now?

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:17.006
There are no elves here,
and even if there were,

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.074
we would not hand them over
to the likes of you.

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:21.777
Well, you're a big talker.

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:26.882
Leave. Leave now or God
will punish you.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:29.285
God? Punishment?

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:31.921
It's all part of this village's legend.

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:34.089
Legend?

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.525
When the darkness of
chaos approaches,

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:38.561
brave warriors from a strange
land shall appear.

00:03:38.585 --> 00:03:42.522
Wielding their cannon of miracles, they
will restore peace to the land.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:53.609
What's this? Praying for a miracle

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:56.145
since you're too puny to defeat us?

00:03:56.169 --> 00:04:00.583
Come on, you know, they call me
"The Hammerhead Buddha."

00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:03.385
| don't want to do any rough housing,
but I've got this problem.

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:06.889
The punks under me have an
itch to make trouble.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:13.028
Even I can't hold them back
forever, you know?

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:16.750
I'm sure you can see what
| mean. Think about it.

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:20.069
Ouch! Who did that?!

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.171
Get away from my big brother!

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:25.374
Leave this village! You pirates!

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:26.866
Blanco!

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:31.680
Well, it seems that troublemakers
run in the family.

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:34.883
Hey kid, do you think the brave
warriors will come?

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:36.652
Of course they will!

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:39.646
Well in that case, let's
play a game, okay?

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:41.790
Blanco!

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:42.091
Andy!
Blanco!

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:43.626
Andy!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:48.030
If the legend is true, then you will
be rescued by the warriors.

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:50.065
Let go of my brother!

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:53.969
We'll wait until dusk. Unless we
get the answer we want,

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.360
your little brother will become
a part of the legends too.

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:02.526
Don't worry, Andy. The brave
warriors will come for sure!

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:07.483
Yeah, listen to your brother.

00:05:07.507 --> 00:05:09.942
All right, you punks, do what
you want until dusk.

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:24.767
Mistress Emily!

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:25.768
Andy...

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:26.268
Mistress Emily, it is not wise
for you to venture outside. Andy...

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:28.504
Mistress Emily, it is not wise for
you to venture outside.

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:30.272
Who knows when they will come here.

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:33.459
Andy, Blanco has been taken
hostage, hasn't he?

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:37.737
Just now, the afternoon
winds informed me.

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:40.132
Andy, I must...

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:45.054
This is something everyone in
the village agreed to do.

00:05:45.078 --> 00:05:47.423
It is thanks to your blessings
as a fairy spirit of wind

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:50.459
that we may venture out
to sea and fish safely.

00:05:50.483 --> 00:05:53.595
Now, it's our turn to protect you.

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:55.431
And...

00:05:55.455 --> 00:05:59.016
And I believe in the village legend.

00:06:00.059 --> 00:06:02.271
Come, we must get you
to the cavern quickly.

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:04.039
All right...

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:06.041
Those hooligans must have
been the notorious

00:06:06.065 --> 00:06:08.944
"Those Who Hunt Elves" everyone has
been talking about recently.

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:10.646
So, they are pirates.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.414
That explains how they keep
popping up everywhere.

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:14.616
When the darkness of
chaos approaches,

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.218
brave warriors from a strange
land shall appear.

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:19.755
Wielding their cannon of miracles, they
will restore peace to the land.

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:21.440
