00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:10.506
Now, now, Junpei. I told you, we have
to avoid stirring up trouble.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.998
I'm sorry.

00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:17.513
Please go right ahead.
This is on the house.

00:07:17.537 --> 00:07:18.714
All right!

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:19.014
Why, thank you.
All right!

00:07:19.038 --> 00:07:20.199
Why, thank you.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:24.686
