brave warriors?

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:31.860
Oh, come now. I thought the brave
warriors were a trio.

00:07:31.884 --> 00:07:34.444
Yeah, yeah. We are Those Who Hunt...

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:38.634
