00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:51.079
Thank heavens, but if
it comes to that...

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:53.081
I'm making preparations.

00:07:53.105 --> 00:07:54.383
What about Blanco?

00:07:54.407 --> 00:07:54.583
We'll work it out.
What about Blanco?

00:07:54.607 --> 00:07:56.285
We'll work it out.

00:07:56.309 --> 00:07:59.279
Elves need to eat, just like us.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.865
