house destroying everything.

00:09:38.911 --> 00:09:39.955
Andy?

00:09:39.979 --> 00:09:40.389
There's still time before the uprising
was supposed to begin. Andy?

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:41.957
There's still time before the uprising
was supposed to begin.

00:09:41.981 --> 00:09:44.814
Did they catch on to our plans
for an armed rebellion?

00:09:45.985 --> 00:09:47.453
