00:12:00.553 --> 00:12:01.063
Wow!

00:12:01.087 --> 00:12:01.863
Damn, she's a beauty!
Wow!

00:12:01.887 --> 00:12:02.130
Damn, she's a beauty!
She gives me the shivers!

00:12:02.154 --> 00:12:02.464
Oh man, just shoot me now! Damn,
she's a beauty! She gives me the shivers!

00:12:02.488 --> 00:12:03.598
Oh man, just shoot me now!
