00:17:20.205 --> 00:17:22.765
Yeah, yeah! Go home!

00:17:23.509 --> 00:17:26.206
Bro!

00:17:34.653 --> 00:17:36.197
Captain!

00:17:36.221 --> 00:17:37.689
Boss!

00:17:40.359 --> 00:17:44.706
Wow, you guys are a sorry
bunch of losers.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:48.724
Do the words "small fish" ring a bell?
You worthless carp!

00:17:58.043 --> 00:18:01.013
Damn, do they want to level
this village, or what?

00:18:01.713 --> 00:18:03.992
Mistress Emily, are you hurt?

00:18:04.016 --> 00:18:06.261
No, I'm fine.

00:18:06.285 --> 00:18:08.263
Hey, Blanco, get down!

00:18:08.287 --> 00:18:10.255
Take a look, Andy.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.707
Is that...

00:18:19.731 --> 00:18:20.008
The Cannon of Miracles!
Is that...

00:18:20.032 --> 00:18:21.329
The Cannon of Miracles!

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:23.878
When the darkness of
chaos approaches,

00:18:23.902 --> 00:18:25.780
brave warriors from a strange
land shall appear.

00:18:25.804 --> 00:18:27.649
Wielding their cannon of miracles,

00:18:27.673 --> 00:18:29.539
they will restore peace to the land.

00:18:31.276 --> 00:18:34.712
That must be it! They must be
the legendary warriors.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:43.517
Fire! Fire! As long as we get her body,
we don't care if she's alive or dead!

00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:55.801
Boss!

00:18:56.768 --> 00:18:58.236
What?

00:19:10.149 --> 00:19:13.813
Help, I can't swim!

00:19:17.222 --> 00:19:19.801
Perfect timing, Ritsuko!

00:19:19.825 --> 00:19:21.202
Did you think so?

00:19:21.226 --> 00:19:21.302
Did you witness my bold feats?
Did you think so?

00:19:21.326 --> 00:19:23.004
Did you witness my bold feats?

00:19:23.028 --> 00:19:26.074
Sure, like the time the shark
almost cut you in half?

00:19:26.098 --> 00:19:28.443
That's was only because I let
my guard down a little.

00:19:28.467 --> 00:19:30.345
In any case, it seems
that our teamwork

00:19:30.369 --> 00:19:32.413
made this victory possible.
Right, Ms. Airi?

00:19:32.437 --> 00:19:36.451
| guess so. If only we had a
magic-user, then it would be perfect.

00:19:36.475 --> 00:19:37.943
Excuse me...

00:19:38.577 --> 00:19:40.989
Dear brave warriors of legend,

00:19:41.013 --> 00:19:43.458
thank you so much for your help.

00:19:43.482 --> 00:19:43.558
Warriors of legend?

00:19:43.582 --> 00:19:45.460
| can't imagine how to put into words
how grateful we are. Warriors of legend?

00:19:45.484 --> 00:19:46.961
| can't imagine how to put into words how grateful
we are. Let's just leave it at that for now.

00:19:46.985 --> 00:19:47.428
Let's just leave it at that for now.

00:19:47.452 --> 00:19:50.932
If there is anything that we could
do to repay this debt,

00:19:50.956 --> 00:19:52.834
please tell us.

00:19:52.858 --> 00:19:56.204
Come to think of it, didn't you mention
you had business with me?

00:19:56.228 --> 00:19:58.973
Well, yes, we do.

00:19:58.997 --> 00:20:01.843
If there is anything I can do, please
do not hesitate to ask.

00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:03.144
Are you sure we can ask anything?

00:20:03.168 --> 00:20:03.344
Why, of course.
Are you sure we can ask anything?

00:20:03.368 --> 00:20:04.445
Why, of course.

00:20:04.469 --> 00:20:04.646
Why, of course.
Now, you're sure about this?

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.648
Now, you're sure about this?

00:20:06.672 --> 00:20:08.140
Yes...

00:20:11.176 --> 00:20:12.644
Take your clothes off.

00:20:13.312 --> 00:20:14.822
| said, take your clothes off.

00:20:14.846 --> 00:20:16.610
What do you mean "take off?"

00:20:18.517 --> 00:20:20.576
It is an request from the
brave warriors.

00:20:21.186 --> 00:20:23.154
It's not as if they're gonna stuff her.

00:20:24.256 --> 00:20:26.634
It's not as if they want to kill her.

00:20:26.658 --> 00:20:28.403
Wait just a second here!

00:20:28.427 --> 00:20:29.470
Please!

00:20:29.494 --> 00:20:29.904
Unless we take the clothing
off of five chosen elves, Please!

00:20:29.928 --> 00:20:31.906
Unless we take the clothing
off of five chosen elves,

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:34.309
we can't go back to Japan!

00:20:34.333 --> 00:20:36.110
Take off my clothing? Go back?

00:20:36.134 --> 00:20:37.478
We're looking for the
fragments of a spell

00:20:37.502 --> 00:20:40.597
printed on an elf's skin!
So take off your clothes!

00:20:43.942 --> 00:20:45.720
Just explain this to me!

00:20:45.744 --> 00:20:48.356
You promise to believe us
if we explain it to you?

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.158
This is a nightmare!

00:20:50.182 --> 00:20:51.650
It certainly is.

00:20:52.217 --> 00:20:55.230
It's another miss in our search
for the spell fragment.

00:20:55.254 --> 00:20:56.722
| guess so.

00:21:02.094 --> 00:21:04.672
Cheer up, Junpei.

00:21:04.696 --> 00:21:06.975
Hey, you're right.

00:21:06.999 --> 00:21:08.543
| shouldn't let this get me down!

00:21:08.567 --> 00:21:11.246
We are going to tear all the
clothing off of all the elves

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.932
until we can find the spell and
go back to Japan!

00:21:15.107 --> 00:21:17.785
Hey, what about your
broken leg, Ms. Airi?

00:21:17.809 --> 00:21:20.244
I'm so sorry, that was all an act.

00:21:20.979 --> 00:21:23.992
Junpei, you idiot.

00:21:24.016 --> 00:21:25.693
Mistress Emily, this is important!

00:21:25.717 --> 00:21:26.861
Shut up!

00:21:26.885 --> 00:21:27.195
They were "Those Who Hunt Elves!"
Shut up!

00:21:27.219 --> 00:21:29.264
They were "Those Who Hunt Elves!"

00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:31.466
Did it take you this long
to figure that out!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:34.460
You moron!

00:21:53.145 --> 00:22:00.194
It's okay to take a break on a day
when you feel despondent

00:22:00.218 --> 00:22:07.201
Life is long and fickle, you know

00:22:07.225 --> 00:22:14.309
| can make you a hundred
times stronger

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:17.512
Come on, let's sleep for now

00:22:17.536 --> 00:22:21.449
Hold me gently

00:22:21.473 --> 00:22:26.411
Even if you met a dinosaur

00:22:28.547 --> 00:22:35.196
You are the kind of person that
would just laugh it off

00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:41.903
Winning through flower gardens
and storm-ravaged plains

00:22:41.927 --> 00:22:49.544
| can hear how the times are
changing around us

00:22:49.568 --> 00:22:56.217
Distinguishing both the
sour and the sweet

00:22:56.241 --> 00:23:04.241
Just don't give up, because the genius
always comes at the end

00:23:14.192 --> 00:23:15.970
Hello, Junpei here.

00:23:15.994 --> 00:23:17.872
| really like rice with curry sauce.

00:23:17.896 --> 00:23:19.273
To describe how much I like
rice with curry sauce,

00:23:19.297 --> 00:23:21.642
my dream dish would be forty
times the size of Mount Fuji,

00:23:21.666 --> 00:23:23.211
fill up the Marinaras Trench
twenty times,

00:23:23.235 --> 00:23:25.847
and its circumference would be three
times the size of the Earth.

00:23:25.871 --> 00:23:29.584
Oh yeah, the next episode will be
about a shady elf character.

00:23:29.608 --> 00:23:31.953
Next Those Who Hunt Elves:

00:23:31.977 --> 00:23:34.122
"The Birth of the Ultimate
Fighting Group!"

00:23:34.146 --> 00:23:36.911
Stay awake for next week too!
